NOTICE — vendored binary

This package ships a prebuilt binary framework under ios/Frameworks/ and
macos/Frameworks/ (PtTransport.xcframework). The Apache-2.0 grant above covers
this package's own source: ios/Sources/pt_shim.c, ios/Sources/pt_shim.h, the
two podspecs, tools/sync-xcframework.sh and pubspec.yaml.

The framework binary is built from a transport engine that is not yet published
as source. Until it is, a reader cannot reproduce those files from this
repository, and they carry the same caveat as any vendored binary. This is
recorded as an open item in SECURITY.md rather than left for a reader to
discover. Publishing that engine under the same licence is tracked work.
